          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abo bosi ababalwa abokhukambi yaReubeni bali ebikhumila eshikhumi amakhumi karaano nashilala nebikhumi bine namakhumi karaano, mumikanda chiabwe. Nibo abalabeetsanga abakhabili okhurula.",
