        {
          "text": "Mana liheema liokhwakana lilondekhwo, halala neikambi yabaLawi, hakari wetsikambi; shinga olwa bakhoma tsikambi tsiabwe, nolwa balarula bario, buli mundu habunduwe, khubilolelo biabwe.",
